WEBVTT

00:11.090 --> 00:14.850
[Fenglinwan]

00:17.160 --> 00:17.710
Hello.

00:18.160 --> 00:18.730
Hello.

00:23.920 --> 00:25.450
Have you seen these two men?

00:29.270 --> 00:30.440
They're skilled at disguises,

00:30.440 --> 00:33.040
so they may not look the same as
in the pictures.

00:33.280 --> 00:33.920
This is the suitcase

00:33.920 --> 00:35.560
they've been carrying around.

00:35.560 --> 00:37.350
If you see them,
call the police immediately.

00:37.350 --> 00:37.710
Okay.

00:58.220 --> 01:01.340
[Fenglinwan Hotel]

01:01.380 --> 01:09.750
[Delivery]

01:15.840 --> 01:16.990
They're skilled at disguises,

01:16.990 --> 01:19.590
so they may not look the same as
in the pictures.

01:22.150 --> 01:22.870
This is the suitcase

01:22.870 --> 01:24.020
they've been carrying around.

01:24.020 --> 01:26.550
If you see them,
call the police immediately.

02:48.120 --> 02:51.910
[Born with Luck]

02:52.020 --> 02:54.860
[Episode 20]

02:59.120 --> 03:00.280
Only the Weinan District is left.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.470
I'll lead the search there myself today.

03:01.470 --> 03:02.120
At most, one day.

03:02.120 --> 03:02.590
One way or another,

03:02.590 --> 03:04.120
we'll track those two punks down.

03:04.120 --> 03:05.240
T-Then, we're about to

03:05.240 --> 03:06.030
wrap up the case, right?

03:06.030 --> 03:06.760
Pretty much.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.230
-Chief Qi.
-Chief Qi.

03:08.430 --> 03:09.430
How was the meeting
at the Provincial Department?

03:09.430 --> 03:10.290
Very smoothly.

03:11.470 --> 03:13.030
How's the evidence gathering

03:13.030 --> 03:14.150
against Zhou Rong going?

03:14.150 --> 03:15.030
We've already located

03:15.030 --> 03:16.520
the vehicle used by the two suspects

03:16.520 --> 03:17.980
and have locked onto them.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.760
Have they been arrested?

03:20.870 --> 03:21.960
No, why?

03:23.310 --> 03:23.770
Yi'ang,

03:24.520 --> 03:26.520
I'm not trying to pressure you here.

03:26.630 --> 03:28.150
After the meeting yesterday,

03:28.150 --> 03:29.430
Director Gao specifically called me in

03:29.430 --> 03:30.079
and said

03:30.360 --> 03:32.960
the deadline for case review
was approaching.

03:33.470 --> 03:35.130
He wants a specific deadline.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.690
I think we need to move quickly

03:38.150 --> 03:39.710
and try to wrap up within the deadline.

03:39.710 --> 03:40.400
Within a week,

03:40.400 --> 03:41.000
we'll do our best to secure

03:41.000 --> 03:42.600
evidence against Zhou Rong.

03:42.800 --> 03:44.900
Given Director Gao's temperament,

03:45.430 --> 03:46.310
since he asked,

03:46.560 --> 03:48.560
he won't let us drag it out that long.

03:49.280 --> 03:50.680
Chief Zhang is indeed the one

03:50.680 --> 03:52.120
who knows Director Gao best.

03:52.120 --> 03:52.590
I know my mentor's temper

03:52.590 --> 03:53.760
too well.

03:53.960 --> 03:54.630
He's an impatient man,

03:54.630 --> 03:56.560
especially when it comes to cases.

03:56.630 --> 03:58.960
By noon tomorrow,
we need to have evidence in hand

03:58.960 --> 04:01.020
to formally open the investigation.

04:02.870 --> 04:03.800
And that time

04:04.590 --> 04:06.050
is what I fought hard for

04:06.400 --> 04:07.460
with Director Gao.

04:09.870 --> 04:10.870
Thanks, Chief Qi.

04:13.310 --> 04:15.110
W-What's there to thank him for?

04:18.510 --> 04:19.240
Chief Zhang.

04:20.240 --> 04:20.970
Chief Zhang.

04:24.240 --> 04:25.810
By tomorrow noon?

04:26.000 --> 04:27.310
That's way too tight.

04:31.510 --> 04:32.909
By Director Gao's logic,

04:33.070 --> 04:33.920
Zhou Rong is now

04:33.920 --> 04:35.240
basically like a sitting duck.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.310
As long as we catch those two

04:36.310 --> 04:37.310
and get the phone,

04:37.560 --> 04:39.090
we can move in and arrest Zhou Rong.

04:39.090 --> 04:40.490
Is it really that simple?

04:41.680 --> 04:42.159
Chief!

04:43.190 --> 04:43.680
Chief.

04:44.159 --> 04:45.630
Officers from the local precinct reported

04:45.630 --> 04:47.000
that last night,
people from Rongcheng Group

04:47.000 --> 04:48.190
booked tickets at Sanyang Travel Agency

04:48.190 --> 04:49.430
for Zhou Rong and Hu Jianren—

04:49.430 --> 04:50.310
a noon flight today

04:50.310 --> 04:52.640
from the provincial capital to Gondwana.

04:54.190 --> 04:55.250
Why go to Gondwana?

04:55.510 --> 04:56.840
They're trying to flee?

04:58.040 --> 04:59.159
Wang, I need you to make a trip.

04:59.159 --> 05:00.160
Where? Gondwana?

05:00.720 --> 05:01.580
To the airport.

05:01.680 --> 05:02.560
And play it by ear.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.190
Without criminal evidence,

05:03.190 --> 05:04.790
what reason are we gonna use?

05:05.250 --> 05:06.310
Just play it by ear.

05:21.800 --> 05:22.430
Yan,

05:22.680 --> 05:23.740
it's Zhang Yi'ang.

05:24.040 --> 05:25.360
I need your help with something.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.560
Two people are trying to flee

05:26.560 --> 05:28.750
by plane from the provincial capital
at noon today.

05:28.750 --> 05:29.430
Can you help me

05:29.430 --> 05:30.360
intercept them?

05:31.480 --> 05:32.210
Thanks!

05:32.600 --> 05:33.330
I owe you one.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.820
Criminal suspects...

05:35.190 --> 05:36.400
They are suspects,

05:36.430 --> 05:37.040
but

05:37.270 --> 05:39.200
we don't have enough evidence yet.

05:39.800 --> 05:42.070
Aren't you familiar with border control?

05:42.070 --> 05:44.070
See if you can figure something out.

05:44.830 --> 05:46.360
How could I joke about this?

06:25.390 --> 06:25.920
Chief.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.160
The ones who robbed Zhou Rong
and beat Lang Bowen

06:29.160 --> 06:31.000
really weren't Mao and Xia Tinggang.

06:31.000 --> 06:31.930
It was these two.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.260
Can't see their faces.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.560
What should we do now?

06:38.000 --> 06:39.930
Let's not jump to conclusions yet.

06:40.040 --> 06:40.870
Try to find a way

06:40.870 --> 06:41.870
to get clearer photos

06:41.870 --> 06:42.800
of them.

06:44.850 --> 06:46.930
[Police]

06:50.590 --> 06:52.409
[Lu Zheng Car Crash Case]

06:54.950 --> 06:55.970
Did you bring the medicine?

06:55.970 --> 06:56.610
Yeah.

07:05.550 --> 07:06.080
Let's go!

07:14.310 --> 07:15.810
Thai beaches,

07:15.870 --> 07:16.920
Hawaiian beaches,

07:16.920 --> 07:18.000
Caribbean beaches—

07:18.000 --> 07:19.870
none of them can compare to Gondwana's.

07:19.870 --> 07:21.630
Gondwana has nudist beaches.

07:22.390 --> 07:23.270
Wonderful.

07:25.390 --> 07:25.950
Mr. Zhou.

07:27.040 --> 07:28.840
There's been a coup in Gondwana.

07:28.920 --> 07:29.630
What?

07:30.070 --> 07:31.400
The flight is canceled.

07:44.830 --> 07:46.490
No, why did you come over here?

07:47.190 --> 07:48.650
I-I'm going to make a call.

07:53.760 --> 07:55.220
May I... I...

07:56.190 --> 07:57.480
I... I...

08:00.720 --> 08:01.510
Excuse me?

08:02.430 --> 08:03.410
Yeah, it's me!

08:04.480 --> 08:05.680
You can call me Peter.

08:05.750 --> 08:06.680
I want to find...

08:06.920 --> 08:07.270
find...

08:07.270 --> 08:08.190
What's the man's name?

08:08.190 --> 08:09.070
Vanuatu!

08:09.120 --> 08:10.190
V-Vanuatu!

08:13.560 --> 08:14.000
What?

08:17.310 --> 08:18.110
Mr. Lu! Mr. Lu!

08:21.560 --> 08:23.070
Someone from the Municipal Bureau
just came.

08:23.070 --> 08:23.680
What for?

08:25.830 --> 08:27.390
They told us to keep an eye out
for these two people.

08:27.390 --> 08:28.430
And they specifically mentioned

08:28.430 --> 08:30.830
that those two are carrying this suitcase.

08:35.549 --> 08:38.840
[Never Bow to Lite]

08:40.150 --> 08:41.669
The Gondwana military government

08:41.669 --> 08:42.750
has announced that it will confiscate

08:42.750 --> 08:44.270
all illegal assets

08:44.320 --> 08:46.250
belonging to foreign colonizers.

08:46.970 --> 08:48.720
Do I look like a foreign colonizer?

08:48.720 --> 08:49.200
No.

08:49.650 --> 08:51.910
Then why are they confiscating my money?

08:52.120 --> 08:53.790
And "Never Bow to Lite?"

08:53.790 --> 08:55.010
What the hell does that even mean?

08:54.150 --> 08:55.510
[Never Bow to Lite]

08:55.230 --> 08:55.760
Mr. Zhou,

08:56.120 --> 08:56.730
I think...

09:02.400 --> 09:02.930
Hello?

09:12.030 --> 09:12.830
There's hope.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.790
Lu Yibo called.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.440
He said the police are
looking for two people

09:18.440 --> 09:19.970
carrying a black suitcase.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.030
Based on the photos the police provided,

09:23.030 --> 09:25.110
those two are not the ones who robbed you.

09:25.110 --> 09:25.880
So the police

09:25.910 --> 09:27.080
can't possibly get the phone

09:27.080 --> 09:27.960
from them.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.250
Let's stay in Sanjiangkou.

09:32.720 --> 09:35.380
We might still have a chance
to turn this around.

09:35.960 --> 09:37.160
Turn around, my foot.

09:40.070 --> 09:41.160
That one seems to be

09:41.910 --> 09:43.360
"Never Bow to Life."

09:45.190 --> 09:46.220
Isn't it "Lite"?

09:47.480 --> 09:48.280
Close enough.

09:53.860 --> 09:54.360
Go back.

09:55.390 --> 09:56.790
And track down those jerks

09:56.790 --> 09:57.920
who screwed me over.

10:01.670 --> 10:02.080
Chief.

10:17.240 --> 10:17.850
Chief.

10:19.030 --> 10:19.550
The HD photos

10:19.550 --> 10:20.640
of those two are in.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.920
It was indeed not Mao and Xia Tinggang.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.060
Should I notify everyone?

10:28.140 --> 10:30.320
[Lu Yibo] [Report Zhou Rong]

10:28.320 --> 10:29.580
Bring Lu Yibo in first.

10:31.770 --> 10:32.260
Okay.

10:39.000 --> 10:39.730
Chief Zhang.

10:42.090 --> 10:43.630
Zhou Rong didn't manage to leave.

10:43.630 --> 10:45.030
He went back to his villa.

10:45.200 --> 10:45.600
Good!

10:46.550 --> 10:47.150
Good!

10:49.510 --> 10:50.080
Good!

10:54.200 --> 10:55.660
Justice won't let him go.

10:55.790 --> 10:56.240
Good.

10:56.440 --> 10:56.870
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

10:56.870 --> 10:57.270
Yeah.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.000
Good.

10:59.390 --> 10:59.750
Good.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.010
I'll go report to Chief Qi.

11:03.600 --> 11:04.900
Zhou Rong's not getting away.

11:04.900 --> 11:05.910
Absolutely not!

11:05.910 --> 11:07.440
He can't get away this time.

11:13.080 --> 11:14.410
He's done for this time.

11:17.120 --> 11:18.030
Zhou Rong didn't leave?

11:18.030 --> 11:18.890
What happened?

11:22.240 --> 11:23.170
What's that for?

11:24.790 --> 11:25.870
Drop the act.

11:26.910 --> 11:27.750
What are you talking about?

11:27.750 --> 11:28.680
The two-man con.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.600
What two-man con?

11:31.550 --> 11:32.350
Are you crazy?

11:39.150 --> 11:39.960
I know

11:40.000 --> 11:40.930
everything now.

11:41.870 --> 11:42.910
The Chief knew all along

11:42.910 --> 11:44.080
that Mao and Xia Tinggang

11:44.080 --> 11:46.000
weren't the ones who robbed Zhou Rong.

11:46.000 --> 11:46.720
Pursuing them was just

11:46.720 --> 11:49.050
a smokescreen to keep Zhou Rong off guard.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.720
Why did the Chief do that?

11:53.320 --> 11:54.450
If you were Zhou Rong

11:54.840 --> 11:56.750
and the most damning evidence against you
went missing

11:56.750 --> 11:58.030
while the police were searching for it,

11:58.030 --> 11:59.030
what would you do?

12:00.220 --> 12:01.720
Find it before the police do.

12:01.720 --> 12:02.120
Wrong.

12:03.150 --> 12:04.240
The safer move

12:04.270 --> 12:05.510
would be to run immediately.

12:05.510 --> 12:07.240
Just like Zhou Rong tried to do.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.870
Yesterday, when you said

12:09.870 --> 12:12.360
Mao and Xia Tinggang
weren't the real culprits,

12:12.360 --> 12:14.360
the Chief had already believed you.

12:14.720 --> 12:16.360
But why did he still ask us to distribute

12:16.360 --> 12:17.820
their photos everywhere?

12:17.850 --> 12:19.780
To keep Zhou Rong calm and in place.

12:22.150 --> 12:23.630
But how would Zhou Rong see

12:23.670 --> 12:25.000
the photos we distributed?

12:25.000 --> 12:26.860
I just came back from Fenglinwan.

12:26.960 --> 12:28.550
The Chief specifically emphasized

12:28.550 --> 12:30.360
distributing them
to hotels and restaurants.

12:30.360 --> 12:31.200
Would punks

12:31.240 --> 12:32.240
like Mao and Xia Tinggang

12:32.240 --> 12:33.770
ever go to places like that?

12:33.840 --> 12:34.840
Still denying it?

12:37.500 --> 12:38.360
Then how did you figure out

12:38.360 --> 12:39.360
the Chief's plan?

12:40.750 --> 12:42.460
Don't think you're the only smart ones—

12:42.460 --> 12:43.960
keeping everything from me like that.

12:43.960 --> 12:44.960
But I'm diligent.

12:46.120 --> 12:48.180
Yesterday, the Chief recited a poem:

12:48.200 --> 12:49.120
"Sorrowful eyes,

12:49.120 --> 12:50.910
unable to see through your heart."

12:50.910 --> 12:51.670
That's from a piece he published

12:51.670 --> 12:53.910
in the Provincial Department's
monthly journal four years ago.

12:53.910 --> 12:54.630
The title is

12:54.720 --> 12:56.320
"I Won't Let You Leave."

12:56.750 --> 12:57.750
Who didn't leave?

12:57.960 --> 12:59.290
Zhou Rong didn't leave.

12:59.790 --> 13:00.750
I've carefully read every poem

13:00.750 --> 13:02.280
the Chief has ever written.

13:05.240 --> 13:06.500
Hello, the task force.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.080
Really?

13:09.550 --> 13:10.750
How did you find them?

13:11.550 --> 13:11.910
Okay.

13:12.280 --> 13:13.140
What happened?

13:14.000 --> 13:15.270
They found the two real suspects

13:15.270 --> 13:16.730
at Ruihao Boutique Hotel.

13:17.320 --> 13:18.390
Are you sure it's them?

13:18.390 --> 13:19.840
We haven't even sent out the photos yet.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.720
It was a delivery worker

13:20.720 --> 13:22.380
who recognized the suitcase.

13:23.150 --> 13:23.950
See?

13:24.320 --> 13:25.240
It was also the Chief's idea

13:25.240 --> 13:27.440
to send out the photos of that suitcase.

13:28.550 --> 13:30.240
Li Qian and Song Xing
are already on their way.

13:30.240 --> 13:31.150
Tell them not to go in yet

13:31.150 --> 13:32.080
and wait until we get there.

13:32.080 --> 13:32.600
Okay.

13:37.660 --> 13:39.660
[Loyalty]

13:46.970 --> 13:47.480
Stop, stop.

13:47.480 --> 13:48.210
Chief Zhang.

13:51.130 --> 13:52.330
Let him go in and wait!

14:03.060 --> 14:06.320
[Ruihao Boutique Hotel]

14:12.240 --> 14:14.240
How about I go in
and scope out the situation first?

14:14.240 --> 14:16.440
Let's wait for the Chief and the others.

14:16.510 --> 14:17.710
What if it's not them?

14:18.720 --> 14:20.320
You stay here and keep watch.

14:21.340 --> 14:27.560
[Ruihao Boutique Hotel]

14:34.840 --> 14:35.370
Hello.

14:38.750 --> 14:39.470
What?

14:42.670 --> 14:43.080
[Police]

14:44.250 --> 14:45.380
Officer?

14:45.840 --> 14:46.870
What's the matter?

14:46.870 --> 14:48.800
Let me see the surveillance video.

14:52.670 --> 14:53.530
What happened?

14:54.150 --> 14:54.670
Well...

15:05.080 --> 15:05.630
Chao,

15:06.270 --> 15:08.530
I don't want to pretend to be blind today.

15:09.130 --> 15:11.060
I also wanted to give you a new look.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.530
But do we have anything?

15:12.630 --> 15:16.160
Would we be in this mess
if you hadn't caused trouble yesterday?

15:17.440 --> 15:18.000
Chao.

15:19.750 --> 15:22.320
I think you're better at
acting blind than I am.

15:22.320 --> 15:23.980
Today you'll be the blind one.

15:58.000 --> 16:00.050
I just want to get a room
with my girlfriend.

16:00.050 --> 16:01.450
Can we do it without an ID?

16:01.540 --> 16:02.510
No problem.

16:06.240 --> 16:08.970
Honey, did you bring
my disability certificate?

16:09.080 --> 16:11.410
Did you bring my disability certificate?

16:11.510 --> 16:12.080
No.

16:12.080 --> 16:13.720
Let's go back and get it.

16:31.750 --> 16:32.880
What's wrong, Chao?

16:33.200 --> 16:34.530
I think that guy's a cop.

16:35.200 --> 16:36.130
What do you want?

16:37.600 --> 16:38.360
We go all in.

16:44.870 --> 16:45.490
[Shiweixuan Restaurant]

16:47.550 --> 16:48.120
All in.

17:07.920 --> 17:08.319
Hello?

17:08.550 --> 17:08.960
Hello?

17:09.200 --> 17:09.920
I've trapped the suspects

17:09.920 --> 17:10.640
in the room.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.400
Requesting backup.

17:11.400 --> 17:12.680
Chao, this pillow is too small.

17:12.680 --> 17:13.589
I'm afraid we'll sprain our ankles.

17:13.589 --> 17:14.170
Idiot,

17:14.200 --> 17:15.000
when jumping from a height,

17:15.000 --> 17:17.730
the most important thing
is to protect your head.

17:26.400 --> 17:26.880
I...

17:42.240 --> 17:43.880
Hurry! They ran away!

17:48.350 --> 17:49.540
Where is the back door?

17:49.540 --> 17:50.800
Where is the back door?

17:54.510 --> 17:55.090
Chao,

17:55.200 --> 17:56.640
why are we taking the back door?

17:56.640 --> 17:58.350
There must be an ambush at the front door.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.280
Freeze! Police!

18:02.390 --> 18:04.060
You brat, you can still sit up?

18:04.090 --> 18:04.730
Let's go!

18:06.180 --> 18:07.110
Freeze! Police!

18:09.000 --> 18:09.630
Are you okay?

18:09.630 --> 18:11.230
Never mind me, go after them!

18:12.270 --> 18:12.930
Suspects spotted.

18:12.850 --> 18:14.130
♪ He ♪

18:12.960 --> 18:14.090
Requesting backup!

18:15.600 --> 18:19.840
♪ A rusted flower etched
across his chest ♪

18:21.890 --> 18:22.860
♪ Oh, he ♪

18:24.690 --> 18:27.980
♪ Says your worldview's still too small ♪

18:31.820 --> 18:35.670
♪ A rat that steals rice—
humans call it cunning ♪

18:36.320 --> 18:40.230
♪ A human who steals honey—
calls the bees hardworking ♪

18:40.890 --> 18:44.840
♪ Absurd, greedy—
self-proclaimed superior beings ♪

18:45.410 --> 18:48.060
♪ Hypocritical, wasteful, hollow ♪

18:47.160 --> 18:47.620
Freeze!

18:54.640 --> 18:55.200
Stop!

19:15.700 --> 19:17.450
[Professional Bicycle Repair]

19:31.720 --> 19:32.250
This way.

19:41.110 --> 19:41.960
When we were coming this way,

19:41.960 --> 19:43.150
we didn't know what was going on.

19:43.150 --> 19:44.310
Boom! It just exploded.

19:44.310 --> 19:46.040
Yeah, scared the hell out of me.

19:46.830 --> 19:48.590
This is so gross!

19:48.620 --> 19:49.080
Well...

19:49.200 --> 19:50.310
It's everywhere!

19:51.000 --> 19:51.980
How are we supposed to get through?

19:51.980 --> 19:52.800
It stinks!

19:53.920 --> 19:55.380
Why didn't you wait for us?

19:55.550 --> 19:57.010
Why did you act on your own?

19:57.030 --> 19:58.260
I didn't act on my own.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.680
I just wanted to go in and confirm

19:59.680 --> 20:01.190
whether it was really those two.

20:01.190 --> 20:02.310
I didn't even give away my identity.

20:02.310 --> 20:02.830
I don't know why,

20:02.830 --> 20:03.440
but they just ran away.

20:03.440 --> 20:03.920
Song Xing,

20:03.920 --> 20:05.440
this isn't the first time
you've screwed up.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.240
What exactly do you want?

20:06.240 --> 20:07.240
Had enough of being
a criminal police officer?

20:07.240 --> 20:08.030
Want to go push papers
at the Household Registration Office,

20:08.030 --> 20:08.480
huh?

20:09.880 --> 20:10.750
Go to the hospital first.

20:10.750 --> 20:11.920
Chief, I'm actually fine.

20:11.920 --> 20:12.400
Stop arguing!

20:12.400 --> 20:13.460
Go to the hospital!

20:24.510 --> 20:24.960
Chief Zhang.

20:24.960 --> 20:25.760
Captain Wang.

20:26.350 --> 20:28.070
The way those two blew up the sewer

20:28.070 --> 20:29.000
is identical to

20:29.000 --> 20:31.260
the provincial capital explosion case.

20:32.030 --> 20:32.750
Let's go to the hotel first,

20:32.750 --> 20:34.310
collect biological evidence of those two,

20:34.310 --> 20:34.910
and take it

20:34.920 --> 20:35.790
to compare with the one

20:35.790 --> 20:36.750
from the explosion case.

20:36.750 --> 20:37.280
Yes, sir.

20:39.270 --> 20:40.000
Chief Zhang.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.080
It's already noon.

20:42.310 --> 20:43.350
Can we still make it

20:43.350 --> 20:44.480
by tomorrow at noon?

20:45.400 --> 20:46.070
Can't we?

20:46.550 --> 20:47.110
Can't we?

20:51.000 --> 20:51.640
Can we?

20:53.310 --> 20:54.260
Right now,

20:54.300 --> 20:55.920
these are the people involved:

20:55.920 --> 20:56.400
me,

20:57.720 --> 20:58.200
you,

20:58.990 --> 20:59.690
Zhu Yifei,

21:00.400 --> 21:01.060
Lang Bowen,

21:02.350 --> 21:03.010
and Lu Yibo.

21:03.640 --> 21:05.200
Lang Bowen is the most suspicious.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.350
But even if he wanted to drag me down—

21:06.350 --> 21:07.720
he took care of Lu Zheng himself.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.510
There's no way he'd just sit in a hospital

21:08.510 --> 21:09.710
waiting to be caught.

21:09.820 --> 21:10.750
As for Zhu Yifei,

21:11.030 --> 21:12.460
he's an outsider.

21:12.550 --> 21:13.380
He has neither the motive

21:13.380 --> 21:15.240
nor the influence to mess with me.

21:19.720 --> 21:20.250
Mr. Zhou.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.640
Whoever I might suspect,

21:22.920 --> 21:24.030
it wouldn't be you.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.720
Mr. Zhou, Ren!

21:28.270 --> 21:28.940
Um...

21:29.550 --> 21:30.270
This morning,

21:30.270 --> 21:32.170
Lu Yibo went to
the Municipal Public Security Bureau.

21:32.170 --> 21:33.350
What did he go there for?

21:33.350 --> 21:33.830
No idea.

21:34.480 --> 21:35.440
But the people at Fenglinwan said

21:35.440 --> 21:36.570
he definitely went.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.670
I've underestimated you.

21:47.080 --> 21:47.790
You go right now

21:47.790 --> 21:49.160
and wait outside the Municipal Bureau.

21:49.160 --> 21:50.070
As soon as he comes out,

21:50.070 --> 21:51.560
bring him here!

21:52.370 --> 21:54.050
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

22:12.030 --> 22:12.590
Officer,

22:13.350 --> 22:14.200
when will Chief Zhang

22:14.200 --> 22:15.310
be able to receive me?

22:15.310 --> 22:15.970
"Receive?"

22:17.030 --> 22:18.640
No, question me.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.450
"Question?"

22:20.680 --> 22:22.240
What's the proper term then?

22:22.240 --> 22:23.000
I can't just wait here

22:23.000 --> 22:23.930
forever, right?

22:24.350 --> 22:26.000
The Chief went out on official business.

22:26.000 --> 22:27.790
Just wait patiently as you were told.

22:27.790 --> 22:28.240
If you don't want to wait,

22:28.240 --> 22:29.570
you can leave right now.

22:48.830 --> 22:49.310
Chief.

22:52.830 --> 22:53.840
Life is

22:54.030 --> 22:55.230
full of ups and downs.

23:00.830 --> 23:02.550
You have to endure the quiet times

23:02.550 --> 23:04.410
before you can embrace the glory.

23:06.030 --> 23:06.720
Am I really going to be

23:06.720 --> 23:08.200
transferred away from the frontline?

23:08.200 --> 23:09.240
Who said that? No.

23:10.160 --> 23:10.720
Then why are you

23:10.720 --> 23:11.920
saying all that to me?

23:12.920 --> 23:14.210
I just think...

23:14.270 --> 23:15.870
You don't need to comfort me.

23:16.110 --> 23:18.080
Just tell me the truth.

23:18.200 --> 23:18.880
Am I really being

23:18.880 --> 23:20.270
transferred to
the Household Registration Office?

23:20.270 --> 23:21.270
You can't go there.

23:21.270 --> 23:23.270
Their staffing quota is already full.

23:23.270 --> 23:24.470
Then where am I going?

23:24.680 --> 23:25.480
Nowhere.

23:26.310 --> 23:27.880
You're staying with the task force.

23:27.880 --> 23:29.680
Why aren't you disciplining me?

23:30.790 --> 23:32.190
Think about it yourself.

23:37.160 --> 23:39.090
Unless I didn't do anything wrong.

23:39.280 --> 23:40.340
Is that it, Chief?

23:41.590 --> 23:43.390
You could interpret it that way.

23:50.400 --> 23:51.400
I understand now.

23:53.270 --> 23:54.000
Chief Zhang!

23:55.240 --> 23:56.040
Captain Wang!

23:58.030 --> 24:00.690
You're like
a completely different person now.

24:01.480 --> 24:02.930
What did the Chief say to you?

24:02.930 --> 24:03.650
The Chief

24:03.680 --> 24:04.810
told me everything.

24:05.160 --> 24:05.680
Understood?

24:05.680 --> 24:06.410
Understood.

24:06.680 --> 24:08.590
Understand the Chief's intentions now?

24:08.590 --> 24:09.030
I do.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.600
No more mistakes from now on.

24:11.880 --> 24:12.410
Yes, sir.

24:13.640 --> 24:14.370
Chief Zhang.

24:15.270 --> 24:17.000
The fingerprint match results

24:17.160 --> 24:19.160
for Liu Bei's killer have come back.

24:19.960 --> 24:20.350
Huo Zheng.

24:20.080 --> 24:22.180
[Wanted Person Registration Form]

24:20.720 --> 24:21.440
He's also a hitman,

24:21.440 --> 24:22.240
a wanted criminal.

24:22.240 --> 24:24.170
He was there to protect the seller.

24:25.830 --> 24:26.500
Find him.

24:27.960 --> 24:29.480
Why are you still standing here?
Go issue the wanted notice.

24:29.480 --> 24:30.010
Yes, sir!

24:32.750 --> 24:33.610
One more thing.

24:33.830 --> 24:35.630
Lu Yibo is still waiting for you.

24:35.880 --> 24:37.010
He's still waiting?

24:37.200 --> 24:38.060
Let him go back.

24:38.980 --> 24:40.580
He's been waiting here all day,
and you're not going to see him?

24:40.580 --> 24:41.270
Well,

24:41.590 --> 24:42.850
we almost caught the suspects today.

24:42.850 --> 24:43.390
What

24:43.590 --> 24:45.000
could we possibly
get out of him at this point?

24:45.000 --> 24:46.160
Let's focus on the important work.

24:46.160 --> 24:46.960
Send him home. Let him go.

24:46.960 --> 24:47.490
Alright.

24:49.400 --> 24:50.030
Doctor.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.960
Doctor, could you
take a look at this for me?

24:52.960 --> 24:53.690
I'm off duty.

24:53.830 --> 24:54.960
Come back at 1:00 PM.

24:55.160 --> 24:55.750
Sorry,

24:55.790 --> 24:57.750
but could you just take a quick look?

24:57.750 --> 24:58.520
Lately,

24:58.550 --> 24:59.680
I've had no appetite

24:59.720 --> 25:01.250
and constantly feel tired.

24:59.800 --> 25:00.670
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital
Laboratory Test Report]

25:00.710 --> 25:02.030
[Test Item] [Sex Hormone Panel]

25:01.400 --> 25:01.960
I want to know

25:01.960 --> 25:03.820
if I have an endocrine imbalance.

25:05.110 --> 25:06.770
Based on your hormone levels,

25:06.920 --> 25:07.920
you're pregnant.

25:09.480 --> 25:10.610
That's impossible.

25:10.750 --> 25:11.680
Nothing has happened.

25:11.680 --> 25:12.510
Nothing what?

25:14.920 --> 25:16.320
It's only been a few days.

25:16.440 --> 25:17.070
Go get

25:17.070 --> 25:18.400
a beta-hCG test.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.880
Even if it's just a week into pregnancy,

25:19.880 --> 25:21.620
the test can pick it up.

25:22.310 --> 25:23.240
Thank you.

25:25.650 --> 25:27.420
[Test Item] [Sex Hormone Panel]

25:28.640 --> 25:29.590
I'm pregnant?

25:48.680 --> 25:49.440
Get in.

26:08.640 --> 26:09.240
Ren.

26:10.750 --> 26:11.830
Where are we going?

26:13.790 --> 26:15.190
Mr. Rong wants to see you.

26:16.000 --> 26:16.930
What's it about?

26:31.240 --> 26:31.790
Hello?

26:32.350 --> 26:33.200
Hello, Yibo.

26:33.880 --> 26:35.550
I have good news for you.

26:37.310 --> 26:38.840
You're going to be a father!

26:42.970 --> 26:44.430
Let's talk when I get back.

26:45.070 --> 26:45.870
What's wrong?

26:46.750 --> 26:47.550
Where are you?

26:49.480 --> 26:50.740
I'm in Ren's car.

26:51.160 --> 26:52.670
Where are you going with Ren?

26:52.670 --> 26:54.470
Mr. Zhou needs me for something.

26:54.590 --> 26:56.050
Why does he want to see you?

26:56.180 --> 26:56.910
Stop asking.

26:57.190 --> 26:57.850
I have to go.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.190
So, what did you

27:17.720 --> 27:19.350
talk about with Zhang Yi'ang?

27:19.350 --> 27:19.790
Rong,

27:20.330 --> 27:21.990
I really didn't get to see him.

27:22.350 --> 27:23.770
Then who did you see?

27:24.070 --> 27:25.200
I didn't see anyone.

27:26.240 --> 27:27.610
They just had me waiting

27:27.640 --> 27:29.270
i-in a meeting room the whole time,

27:29.270 --> 27:31.400
a-and then let me go.

27:33.070 --> 27:34.930
The world shouldn't be like this.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.540
People

27:37.200 --> 27:38.930
shouldn't be like this either.

27:40.160 --> 27:40.690
Mr. Zhou,

27:41.400 --> 27:42.520
if I'm lying to you,

27:42.960 --> 27:44.510
I can die right now!

27:45.960 --> 27:46.750
How?

27:48.440 --> 27:49.440
Could you bear to?

27:53.270 --> 27:53.830
What?

27:54.720 --> 27:56.880
Getting desperate enough
to do something rash?

27:56.880 --> 27:57.310
Rong,

27:58.030 --> 27:59.000
if you don't believe me,

27:59.000 --> 27:59.640
I'll jump now

27:59.640 --> 28:00.680
and drown myself!

28:02.070 --> 28:02.880
If you don't let me up,

28:02.880 --> 28:04.480
I won't take a single breath!

28:12.640 --> 28:13.270
Yibo!

28:13.640 --> 28:14.310
Yibo!

28:16.030 --> 28:17.560
You're serious about this?

28:18.310 --> 28:19.790
Come up here and explain yourself clearly.

28:19.790 --> 28:21.440
No need to be so drastic about it!

28:21.440 --> 28:22.550
He can't hear you.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.030
I have experience.

28:25.440 --> 28:26.440
When I had an episode last time,

28:26.440 --> 28:27.400
you were shouting outside,
and I couldn't hear a thing,

28:27.400 --> 28:28.460
no matter how loud.

28:30.400 --> 28:33.060
How long did I stay underwater
in that fish tank?

28:33.790 --> 28:35.110
Two or three minutes.

28:37.110 --> 28:38.170
If he's still alive

28:38.750 --> 28:39.950
after three minutes,

28:40.830 --> 28:41.560
pull him out.

28:42.550 --> 28:43.830
What if he can't hold it

28:43.920 --> 28:44.980
and comes up early?

28:51.810 --> 28:52.720
What comes after

28:52.720 --> 28:53.960
is yours to handle.

28:55.110 --> 28:56.860
We grew up together.

28:57.310 --> 28:58.910
I can't bring myself to do it.

28:59.240 --> 28:59.970
Understood.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.950
[Alarm] [3:00 minutes]

29:04.640 --> 29:05.170
Mr. Zhou!

29:05.480 --> 29:06.000
Ren!

29:06.880 --> 29:07.420
Um,

29:07.640 --> 29:08.500
Zhou Qi is here.

29:08.960 --> 29:09.850
Mr. Zhou!

29:10.920 --> 29:11.480
Mr. Zhou.

29:12.350 --> 29:13.150
Where is Yibo?

29:13.720 --> 29:14.520
Yibo...

29:14.640 --> 29:15.400
is swimming.

29:17.030 --> 29:17.640
Yibo!

29:18.790 --> 29:19.470
Mr. Zhou.

29:19.550 --> 29:20.250
Mr. Zhou.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.240
I'm begging you.

29:21.830 --> 29:23.100
Please let him go.

29:23.590 --> 29:24.970
Please spare him.

29:25.720 --> 29:26.400
Qi,

29:27.550 --> 29:28.800
Yibo is playing a game

29:28.830 --> 29:30.110
with Mr. Zhou.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.310
He's doing it willingly.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.440
No one's forcing him.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.110
Yibo!

29:34.720 --> 29:35.640
Yibo!

29:36.110 --> 29:37.910
If we die, we die together.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.680
The three of us die together!

29:39.830 --> 29:40.480
Yibo,

29:40.590 --> 29:41.550
I'm coming!

29:43.350 --> 29:44.160
Yibo!

29:44.960 --> 29:45.720
Yibo!

29:46.910 --> 29:49.040
-What a couple those two are...
-Yibo!

29:49.240 --> 29:51.530
She just said "the three of us."

29:51.790 --> 29:52.720
Who's the third?

29:55.030 --> 29:56.400
What are you doing?

29:56.400 --> 29:57.090
Qi,

29:57.200 --> 29:58.380
why are you here?

29:58.440 --> 29:59.960
I was worried about you!

29:59.960 --> 30:00.640
Mr. Zhou,

30:01.310 --> 30:02.750
two minutes, fifty-nine seconds.

30:02.750 --> 30:03.420
Mr. Zhou,

30:03.790 --> 30:04.960
she didn't know anything

30:04.960 --> 30:06.510
about me coming to the police station!

30:06.510 --> 30:07.120
Mr. Zhou,

30:07.140 --> 30:08.270
should we fulfill their wish?

30:08.270 --> 30:09.580
No, no, no!

30:10.440 --> 30:11.870
I'll go back to drowning.

30:12.070 --> 30:12.720
Please,

30:13.070 --> 30:14.510
let her go, okay?

30:15.480 --> 30:15.960
I'm pregnant.

30:15.960 --> 30:17.640
She's carrying my child.

30:20.160 --> 30:21.310
W-Who...

30:21.750 --> 30:22.810
W-Who is pregnant?

30:23.000 --> 30:24.240
What kind of question is that?

30:24.240 --> 30:24.880
He said she's pregnant.

30:24.880 --> 30:25.750
She's the only woman here.

30:25.750 --> 30:26.750
Who else could it be?

30:26.750 --> 30:27.750
No, he...

30:28.000 --> 30:29.270
How would I know?

30:29.510 --> 30:29.960
Rong.

30:31.270 --> 30:32.030
Mr. Zhou.

30:35.630 --> 30:36.440
Mr. Zhou.

30:37.030 --> 30:39.360
Please, let my child
have a chance to live.

30:41.550 --> 30:42.270
Mr. Zhou,

30:42.640 --> 30:44.020
I'm begging you.

30:44.350 --> 30:45.510
Please let us go.

30:45.590 --> 30:47.850
Our child can't grow up without a father.

30:48.920 --> 30:49.440
I...

30:50.000 --> 30:50.740
Lu Yibo, I...

30:50.770 --> 30:52.510
Which word of yours
am I supposed to believe?

30:52.510 --> 30:54.040
You told me you couldn't...

30:55.750 --> 30:57.720
You told me you'd never touched her.

30:57.720 --> 30:58.780
Just that one time.

30:59.310 --> 31:00.420
Please believe me.

31:00.550 --> 31:02.550
After leaving your place that time,

31:03.600 --> 31:05.230
I finally managed to do it.

31:21.960 --> 31:22.440
Rong.

31:24.550 --> 31:26.830
You really didn't say anything
to Zhang Yi'ang?

31:26.830 --> 31:28.760
I really didn't even get to see him.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.600
I'll trust you one last time.

31:34.990 --> 31:36.360
Is it really yours?

31:37.400 --> 31:38.160
Yes.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.670
It is mine!

31:39.830 --> 31:40.240
Well,

31:40.480 --> 31:42.640
shouldn't you at least
do the math on the dates?

31:42.640 --> 31:43.560
No need.

31:44.880 --> 31:45.720
It's Qi's,

31:45.880 --> 31:46.790
then it's mine!

31:49.510 --> 31:51.440
Are you insane?

31:51.460 --> 31:54.310
Your dying here
would still be an embarrassment to me.

31:54.310 --> 31:56.170
How could I have a friend like him?

31:58.160 --> 31:59.740
Ren, can I come up now?

31:59.790 --> 32:00.390
Ren!

32:00.480 --> 32:00.960
Qi,

32:01.400 --> 32:02.610
why did you come?

32:02.640 --> 32:04.110
I was worried about you!

32:04.260 --> 32:05.710
Be careful with our baby!

32:05.750 --> 32:07.550
I can't live without you!

32:25.180 --> 32:27.140
[Crime Scene Fingerprint Record Card]

32:25.880 --> 32:27.200
The fingerprints have been matched.

32:27.200 --> 32:27.790
These two

32:27.240 --> 32:27.990
[Fingerprint Comparison]

32:28.270 --> 32:29.480
are the suspects

32:29.480 --> 32:30.680
in the provincial capital explosion case.

32:30.680 --> 32:31.920
One is called Fang Chao,

32:31.920 --> 32:33.250
and the other is Liu Zhi.

32:35.830 --> 32:37.030
Let me add something.

32:37.240 --> 32:38.030
Because these two

32:38.030 --> 32:39.640
are skilled at disguising themselves,

32:39.640 --> 32:40.960
the Provincial Department's task force

32:40.960 --> 32:41.720
never managed to obtain

32:41.720 --> 32:42.780
their real photos.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.880
Li Qian found these,

32:45.270 --> 32:47.070
which allowed us
to confirm their identities.

32:47.070 --> 32:48.030
Catch these two men.

32:48.030 --> 32:48.880
See if we can uncover

32:48.880 --> 32:49.960
evidence against Zhou Rong from them.

32:49.960 --> 32:50.680
Once we have it,

32:50.680 --> 32:52.030
none of them will get away.

32:52.030 --> 32:53.070
Before noon tomorrow,

32:53.070 --> 32:54.070
we might be able to do it.

32:54.070 --> 32:54.470
Chief,

32:55.070 --> 32:55.670
thumbs up.

32:55.790 --> 32:56.110
No.

32:56.310 --> 32:57.770
The credit goes to Li Qian.

32:57.790 --> 32:58.990
Everyone, thumbs up!

33:01.590 --> 33:02.310
Chief Qi called for me.

33:02.310 --> 33:04.240
I need to go report to Director Gao.

33:05.480 --> 33:06.210
Chief Zhang!

33:07.070 --> 33:07.870
Two thumbs up!

33:08.030 --> 33:08.790
Chief Zhang!

33:08.830 --> 33:10.590
Thumbs up!

33:13.110 --> 33:14.270
Alright, get back to work.

33:14.270 --> 33:15.200
Get back to work.

33:15.440 --> 33:17.480
I'm going back to work, Captain Wang.

33:17.480 --> 33:17.940
I'm out.

33:22.480 --> 33:23.010
Xing?

33:23.030 --> 33:24.110
Xing? You're back.

33:25.810 --> 33:26.990
Song Xing, you're back.

33:26.990 --> 33:29.990
Song Xing, you're back.
What's with that expression?

33:32.430 --> 33:33.480
Song Xing, you're back!

33:33.480 --> 33:34.740
What's with that look?

33:36.830 --> 33:37.810
He's mad.

33:38.440 --> 33:40.640
Who wronged him? He looks so aggrieved.

33:46.160 --> 33:46.960
What's wrong?

33:51.980 --> 33:52.490
Laugh.

33:53.310 --> 33:54.440
Just keep laughing.

33:54.680 --> 33:55.680
Soon enough,

33:55.700 --> 33:56.270
you'll know

33:56.270 --> 33:57.160
who the biggest contributor

33:57.160 --> 33:58.180
to this case really is.

33:58.180 --> 33:59.130
Fine, it's you.

34:00.940 --> 34:01.760
No!

34:02.160 --> 34:03.400
It's the Chief and me!

34:04.310 --> 34:05.300
Yes.

34:05.440 --> 34:06.440
Yes.

34:07.440 --> 34:08.760
What do you even know?

34:09.710 --> 34:11.550
Today was a trap set by the Chief.

34:11.630 --> 34:12.280
He intentionally let

34:12.280 --> 34:13.590
those two suspects escape.

34:13.590 --> 34:15.520
It wasn't me who screwed things up!

34:16.880 --> 34:17.780
Yes, yes.

34:19.670 --> 34:20.600
I'm telling you,

34:20.670 --> 34:21.530
don't doubt me.

34:22.320 --> 34:23.320
Think carefully—

34:23.880 --> 34:25.150
haven't we been unable to find evidence

34:25.150 --> 34:27.080
against Zhou Rong this whole time?

34:27.510 --> 34:28.909
But in Zhou Rong's villa,

34:29.070 --> 34:29.710
Li Qian

34:30.070 --> 34:30.880
overheard those two

34:30.880 --> 34:33.190
planning to make a deal with Zhou Rong
over the phone.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.110
So if we catch them in the act

34:34.110 --> 34:35.280
when they make the deal,

34:35.280 --> 34:37.030
wouldn't that give us evidence?

34:37.030 --> 34:37.800
If today

34:37.840 --> 34:39.100
I had caught those two,

34:39.190 --> 34:39.760
how would they still be able to

34:39.760 --> 34:41.219
make a deal with Zhou Rong?

34:42.510 --> 34:43.370
Get it now?

34:44.110 --> 34:46.110
The Chief let them go on purpose!

34:55.320 --> 34:56.590
Is what you just said true,

34:56.590 --> 34:57.550
or are you talking nonsense?

34:57.550 --> 34:58.680
Of course it's true.

34:58.840 --> 35:01.040
The Chief explicitly hinted at it to me.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.160
Who else

35:02.480 --> 35:03.610
did you tell this to?

35:11.070 --> 35:11.870
What's wrong?

35:12.540 --> 35:13.870
Can you make it by tomorrow at noon?

35:12.580 --> 35:14.040
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

35:16.630 --> 35:18.710
As long as we can catch

35:18.920 --> 35:20.550
the suspects
we've already identified today,

35:20.550 --> 35:21.920
tomorrow should be no problem.

35:21.920 --> 35:22.320
Yes.

35:23.320 --> 35:23.880
But just in case

35:23.880 --> 35:24.630
we fail to catch Zhou Rong,

35:24.630 --> 35:25.890
please don't blame me.

35:26.440 --> 35:27.040
Work hard.

35:28.190 --> 35:29.320
Don't embarrass me.

35:30.880 --> 35:31.680
Director Gao.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.770
Yi'ang is now

35:32.800 --> 35:34.510
making his big move
after lying low for a while.

35:34.510 --> 35:36.170
He's really spread his wings.

35:36.880 --> 35:37.280
Director Gao,

35:36.990 --> 35:40.880
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

35:37.630 --> 35:38.630
please come over.

35:39.510 --> 35:40.240
Hold on a sec.

35:41.110 --> 35:41.640
Chief Qi.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.240
What's wrong?

35:46.590 --> 35:47.710
S-Something's wrong.

35:47.710 --> 35:49.670
Director Gao knew he was claiming
that Chief Zhang...

35:49.670 --> 35:50.470
Zhang Yi'ang.

35:52.510 --> 35:52.920
Here.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.360
Was it you who told Song Xing

35:54.360 --> 35:56.950
to deliberately let
Fang Chao and Liu Zhi escape?

35:56.950 --> 35:59.520
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

35:57.000 --> 35:57.840
What?

35:58.190 --> 35:59.790
Did you ask him to let them go?

36:04.030 --> 36:04.590
No.

36:04.840 --> 36:05.700
Still denying?

36:06.710 --> 36:08.440
Word has already reached
the Provincial Department,

36:08.440 --> 36:10.030
saying you privately told Song Xing

36:10.030 --> 36:10.880
that in order to catch Zhou Rong,

36:10.880 --> 36:13.410
you deliberately
let Fang Chao and Liu Zhi go.

36:13.440 --> 36:14.760
No wonder you dared to promise

36:14.760 --> 36:15.400
that you would definitely

36:15.400 --> 36:16.730
catch him by tomorrow noon!

36:16.730 --> 36:18.350
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

36:16.920 --> 36:19.180
Turns out you resorted to dirty tactics.

36:19.320 --> 36:20.530
Director Gao, this matter...

36:20.530 --> 36:22.130
Chief Zhang, don't admit it.

36:22.320 --> 36:23.340
Just say there was no such thing.

36:23.340 --> 36:24.070
Chief Zhang.

36:24.150 --> 36:24.880
Chief Zhang.

36:25.150 --> 36:26.380
If you admit this,

36:26.440 --> 36:27.880
Director Gao will discipline you.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.070
If you say it was Song Xing's own doing,

36:29.070 --> 36:29.710
we'll handle him internally.

36:29.710 --> 36:30.690
That gives us more room to maneuver.

36:30.690 --> 36:32.320
Now is the critical moment
to solve the case.

36:32.320 --> 36:33.000
We must abandon the rook to save the king.

36:33.000 --> 36:34.070
Sacrifice the part to save the whole.

36:34.070 --> 36:34.800
Chief Zhang,

36:35.070 --> 36:35.960
I shouldn't have

36:35.960 --> 36:36.780
leaked your plan.

36:36.780 --> 36:37.850
Just sacrifice me.

36:57.440 --> 36:57.900
Well...

36:58.020 --> 36:59.030
We're in the middle of a meeting
with Director Gao!

36:59.030 --> 36:59.800
What are you doing?

36:59.800 --> 37:00.530
Get out. Out.

37:05.590 --> 37:06.150
Director Gao,

37:06.150 --> 37:06.880
sorry about that.

37:06.880 --> 37:08.000
The connection just dropped.

37:08.000 --> 37:08.730
Where is Zhang Yi'ang?

37:08.040 --> 37:08.920
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

37:09.630 --> 37:10.440
He stepped out.

37:10.440 --> 37:11.250
Get him back here!

37:10.490 --> 37:11.600
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

37:11.880 --> 37:12.320
Okay.

37:13.190 --> 37:13.710
Yi'ang?

37:14.510 --> 37:15.030
Yi'ang!

37:17.110 --> 37:17.570
Yi'ang.

37:18.030 --> 37:19.070
Pin it on me.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.160
Director Gao.

37:25.320 --> 37:25.920
Director Gao.

37:25.920 --> 37:26.520
He's here.

37:29.860 --> 37:35.370
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

37:30.000 --> 37:30.800
Zhang Yi'ang,

37:32.030 --> 37:33.190
did you instruct Song Xing

37:33.190 --> 37:34.590
to deliberately
let Fang Chao and Liu Zhi go?

37:34.590 --> 37:35.050
Tell me!

37:39.700 --> 37:40.620
Don't admit it.

37:41.110 --> 37:42.320
Director Gao,
the connection is a bit laggy...

37:42.320 --> 37:43.120
Director Gao!

37:45.360 --> 37:47.400
I am now the Deputy Chief
of the Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau

37:47.400 --> 37:49.600
in charge of criminal investigations.

37:50.320 --> 37:52.580
This case falls under our jurisdiction.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.240
If anything goes wrong, it's on me.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.990
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

37:55.880 --> 37:57.760
Everything we've done
is for the sake of solving the case.

37:57.760 --> 37:58.400
Now

37:59.110 --> 38:01.170
is not the time to pursue the details.

38:02.190 --> 38:02.990
Zhang Yi'ang,

38:04.000 --> 38:05.920
haven't seen you for a few days,
and you've grown.

38:05.610 --> 38:07.440
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

38:07.800 --> 38:08.670
Those are suspects

38:08.670 --> 38:09.800
of the provincial capital explosion case!

38:09.800 --> 38:10.920
How dare you!

38:11.550 --> 38:12.920
You have to risk something
to catch something.

38:11.620 --> 38:13.080
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

38:14.400 --> 38:15.480
Screwing things up

38:15.480 --> 38:16.880
is nothing new for you!

38:17.760 --> 38:18.880
If they get away,

38:18.920 --> 38:20.510
can you take responsibility for that?

38:20.510 --> 38:21.360
R-Responsibility...

38:21.360 --> 38:23.230
I'll bear it together with Yi'ang.

38:23.230 --> 38:25.150
I'm the head of the Sanjiangkou Bureau,

38:25.150 --> 38:26.230
the first person accountable.

38:26.230 --> 38:27.930
If you want to punish someone,
punish me first.

38:27.930 --> 38:30.580
[Police Internal Video Communication System]

38:29.300 --> 38:30.100
Director Gao,

38:30.550 --> 38:33.150
we're at a crucial stage
of the investigation.

38:33.230 --> 38:35.510
Just let Yi'ang handle things his way.

38:43.630 --> 38:45.560
I'll give you until noon tomorrow.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.730
If you haven't caught them by then,

38:47.760 --> 38:48.960
you'll answer for it.

38:57.770 --> 38:58.510
Thank you.

40:01.020 --> 40:01.750
Uncle Yifei,

40:02.510 --> 40:04.640
why hasn't Zhou Rong contacted us yet?

40:05.710 --> 40:06.650
Who do you think is

40:06.650 --> 40:07.980
more anxious, him or me?

40:10.030 --> 40:10.880
Z-Zhou Rong.

40:13.840 --> 40:14.610
Exactly.

40:18.550 --> 40:19.280
Uncle Yifei,

40:19.550 --> 40:20.610
when are we eating?

40:20.920 --> 40:21.800
Soon.

40:22.070 --> 40:22.460
Alright.

40:22.460 --> 40:23.550
You're as fat as a pig,

40:23.550 --> 40:24.550
and you're still thinking about food?

40:24.550 --> 40:25.080
Get lost!

40:27.880 --> 40:28.510
Zheng,

40:29.150 --> 40:31.080
I can see you're getting restless.

40:32.030 --> 40:33.190
Why don't you go for a run

40:33.190 --> 40:34.990
and buy me a bottle of fish sauce?

40:48.070 --> 40:48.550
Later,

40:48.630 --> 40:49.110
after we finish checking

40:49.110 --> 40:50.320
these few households,

40:50.320 --> 40:51.320
let's go check somewhere else.

40:51.320 --> 40:51.650
Okay.

40:52.960 --> 40:53.440
Sir,

40:54.110 --> 40:55.780
you just moved here, right?

40:56.320 --> 40:56.670
Yes.

40:57.800 --> 40:58.200
Hello.

40:58.230 --> 40:59.630
We're from the subdistrict office,

40:59.630 --> 41:01.280
conducting a census check.

41:01.310 --> 41:02.000
May I see

41:02.000 --> 41:02.730
your ID card?

41:02.800 --> 41:03.360
Sure.

41:09.550 --> 41:10.120
My ID card.

41:09.920 --> 41:10.690
[Name: Zhu Hao]

41:13.400 --> 41:15.070
Is it just you living here?

41:15.840 --> 41:16.950
We're in the transport business.

41:16.950 --> 41:18.800
There are a few other workers as well.

41:18.800 --> 41:19.400
Then please

41:19.400 --> 41:20.210
have them come out.

41:20.210 --> 41:21.440
We'll register everyone together.

41:21.440 --> 41:22.100
No problem.

41:22.940 --> 41:24.940
[Jiangping Community Resident Registration Form]
[Name: Zhu Hao]

41:23.320 --> 41:23.780
Chubby!

41:25.230 --> 41:26.110
Come out, all of you!

41:26.110 --> 41:26.970
Bring your IDs!

41:27.360 --> 41:28.560
Registration check!

41:30.440 --> 41:31.370
Stand properly!

41:38.490 --> 41:39.270
[Wanted]

41:39.270 --> 41:40.050
[Suspect Photo: Huo Zheng]

41:46.060 --> 41:46.450
[Wanted]

41:46.450 --> 41:46.730
[Suspect Photo: Fang Chao]

41:57.840 --> 41:58.480
[Wanted]

41:59.280 --> 41:59.380
[Wanted]

41:59.410 --> 42:00.060
[Suspect Photo: Xia Tinggang]

42:02.340 --> 42:03.160
Sir,

42:03.230 --> 42:04.960
that vehicle out front is yours, right?

42:04.960 --> 42:05.820
Yes, it's mine.

42:05.920 --> 42:07.320
Then, when you have time,

42:07.320 --> 42:08.710
bring your vehicle registration
and driver's license

42:08.710 --> 42:09.550
to our office.

42:09.580 --> 42:10.710
We'll issue you an entry-exit permit.

42:10.710 --> 42:11.070
Okay.

42:11.510 --> 42:12.440
Okay, thank you.

42:12.440 --> 42:13.650
Alright, we won't trouble you further.

42:13.650 --> 42:14.510
Okay. Alright.

42:16.710 --> 42:17.360
Sir!

42:17.920 --> 42:20.680
Well, you haven't told me

42:20.770 --> 42:22.170
how to get to your office.

42:23.280 --> 42:24.670
Building 27, ground floor.

42:24.670 --> 42:26.130
There's a sign by the door.

42:28.960 --> 42:30.690
Huo Zheng!
